WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:10.581
Cozlin laughed. "It's fine if your tiny friend is on another planet, Rocket Girl. We'll just get him."

2
00:00:10.582 --> 00:00:15.077
Roxy shook her head. "He's not on another planet.

3
00:00:15.078 --> 00:00:19.171
He's in another world, like a different universe."

4
00:00:19.172 --> 00:00:23.571
She groaned. "If only there was a way to—"

5
00:00:23.572 --> 00:00:27.056
"Oh, so we need a portal?" Cozlin asked.

6
00:00:27.057 --> 00:00:33.759
Roxy raised an eyebrow. "You know how to get a portal to another world?"

7
00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:40.889
Cozlin laughed. "Of course! Doesn't Earth use portal technology?"

8
00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:43.268
"No," Roxy said.

9
00:00:43.269 --> 00:00:48.125
Cozlin shook her head. "Your planet is strange."

10
00:00:48.126 --> 00:00:52.502
"Strange, you," Bippo said to Roxy.

11
00:00:52.503 --> 00:00:57.076
"Hey!" Roxy said. "That's not nice."

12
00:00:57.077 --> 00:01:02.212
Bippo looked down. "Sorry, me."

13
00:01:02.213 --> 00:01:05.705
"How will we get a portal?" Dr. Odd asked.

14
00:01:05.706 --> 00:01:10.637
"Rocket Girl and I will go to the planet Hulzar," Cozlin said.

15
00:01:10.638 --> 00:01:15.631
"The Hulzarians are the galaxy's best portal makers."

16
00:01:15.632 --> 00:01:20.343
Her shoulders slumped. "But I just remembered something.

17
00:01:20.344 --> 00:01:24.372
We don't have a spaceship to get there."

18
00:01:24.373 --> 00:01:31.336
"I have spaceships," Dr. Odd said. "But they can't escape the magnetic energy here."

19
00:01:31.337 --> 00:01:39.013
Roxy grinned. "I can carry the spaceship into space. I have superstrength."

20
00:01:39.014 --> 00:01:43.505
"Me too," Cozlin said quickly.

21
00:01:43.506 --> 00:01:46.262
Dr. Odd led them to a large room.

22
00:01:46.263 --> 00:01:51.460
He opened the hatch of a small spaceship. "You can take this one."

23
00:01:51.461 --> 00:01:56.944
"Great!" Roxy lifted the spaceship.

24
00:01:56.945 --> 00:02:00.103
Bippo held tightly to her shoulder.

25
00:02:00.104 --> 00:02:05.204
She flew up and away from the moon.

26
00:02:05.205 --> 00:02:08.822
"Strong, us!" Bippo said.

27
00:02:08.823 --> 00:02:14.814
"That's right, Bippo!" Roxy said. "We are really—Uh-oh!"

28
00:02:14.815 --> 00:02:19.913
Despite using all her superstrength, Roxy couldn't keep moving away from Groon.

29
00:02:19.914 --> 00:02:25.980
The magnetic energy pulled her back down to the surface.

30
00:02:25.981 --> 00:02:33.222
"Oof!" Roxy slammed into a pile of scrap metal near Dr. Odd's moon.

31
00:02:33.223 --> 00:02:37.410
Cozlin flew over. "Let me try."

32
00:02:37.411 --> 00:02:40.222
She lifted the spaceship and flew up.

33
00:02:40.223 --> 00:02:46.213
A moment later she fell back down too.

34
00:02:46.214 --> 00:02:52.098
"Ugh!" she said. "That magnetic energy is too strong!

35
00:02:52.099 --> 00:02:55.756
We can't get this spaceship off Groon."

36
00:02:55.757 --> 00:03:01.403
Roxy gritted her teeth. "We don't have a choice."

37
00:03:01.404 --> 00:03:04.883
She picked up the spaceship and shot into the sky again.

38
00:03:04.884 --> 00:03:08.619
After a few seconds, she fell with another crash.

39
00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:15.332
Cozlin tried again too, but the magnetic energy quickly dragged her back to the surface.

40
00:03:15.333 --> 00:03:18.162
She stomped her foot.

41
00:03:18.163 --> 00:03:25.977
"You two are being silly," Dr. Odd said. "Why don't you work together?"

42
00:03:25.978 --> 00:03:30.817
Roxy grinned sheepishly. "That's a good idea."

43
00:03:30.818 --> 00:03:34.217
Cozlin shrugged. "Sure."

44
00:03:34.218 --> 00:03:39.020
The two superheroes lifted the spaceship and flew upward.

45
00:03:39.021 --> 00:03:43.325
For a moment Roxy felt the magnetic force pulling at the spaceship.

46
00:03:43.326 --> 00:03:47.425
She pushed harder, and so did Cozlin.

47
00:03:47.426 --> 00:03:51.811
Soon they were out in space.

48
00:03:51.812 --> 00:03:54.387
"We did it!" Roxy said.

49
00:03:54.388 --> 00:03:58.587
"Partners, you," Bippo said.

50
00:03:58.588 --> 00:04:04.669
Cozlin smiled. "Yes, I guess we are partners."

51
00:04:04.670 --> 00:04:09.355
They got into the spaceship and turned on a communication device.

52
00:04:09.356 --> 00:04:15.071
"We did it, Dr. Odd!" Roxy said. "We'll be back soon."

53
00:04:15.072 --> 00:04:21.315
"I'll work on the plan while you're gone," Dr. Odd said. "Good luck."

54
00:04:21.316 --> 00:04:25.217
Cozlin set a course for Hulzar.

55
00:04:25.218 --> 00:04:28.190
Then she pulled a power crystal from her pocket.

56
00:04:28.191 --> 00:04:32.665
"This will give the spaceship's engine a boost," she said.

57
00:04:32.666 --> 00:04:42.784
She inserted it into the spaceship's controls.

58
00:04:42.785 --> 00:04:46.665
An hour later they were landing in the capital city of Hulzar.

59
00:04:46.666 --> 00:04:51.256
Roxy saw lots of buildings, but the whole place seemed to be empty.

60
00:04:51.257 --> 00:04:59.551
Roxy frowned. "Where is everyone?"

